{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011SCuv5gzkan9Gv6sAsom6J","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have the full picture. Let me produce the best-tier predictions for all experiments in the plan.\n\n```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: |\n  Original framing 完全成立：OntoCoDec 是首个 universal ontology-constrained structured generation framework，\n  跨 2 任务（RE+EE）× 4 模型（8B×3 + 70B）× 3 数据集验证。\n  70B DocRED unconstrained DR ~11% 彻底否定 \"scale solves it\"；constrained DR ~1.2% 确认跨规模有效性。\n  Enabling dependency + tightness×RV interaction + fallback frequency 三个非显然 finding\n  在 §5 analysis 中以量化数据支撑，审稿人会将其标注为 surprising。\n  Post-hoc EE 99.6% discard 作为 killer comparison 有效消除 \"just filter\" 替代方案。\n  CF tradeoff 通过 type ambiguity 论证 + proactive disclosure + semantic-layer 消融归因被接受为 inherent limitation。\n  Title 升级为 \"universal\" 或 \"task-agnostic\"，reviewer avg score 预期 3.75–4.0。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ========== Phase 0: Violation Landscape (ALL DONE) ==========\n  - name: \"SciERC violation rate (minimal prompt)\"\n    plan_id: P001\n    description: \"Qwen3-8B zero-shot SciERC, minimal prompt, unconstrained. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 15.37\n      RV_pct: 1.39\n      ET_pct: 0.40\n      CF_pct: 0.08\n      total_triples: 1724\n      total_entities: 2474\n      per_relation_DR_Used_for: 0.76\n      per_relation_DR_Compare: 42.42\n      per_relation_DR_Feature_of: 33.54\n    result_rationale: |\n      7-relation SciERC ontology 中，tight-constraint relations (Feature-of τ=0.24, Compare τ=0.18)\n      驱动高 DR，而 loose-constraint Used-for (τ=0.86) 几乎无违规。15.4% 整体 DR 在小 ontology 上\n      已非 trivial。Compare 42.4% 的极高违规率表明 model 对特定 relation 的 type assignment\n      存在系统性偏差，不是随机错误。Conjunction DR=0% (任意 entity type 均合法) 提供负对照。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2: Per-relation violation rates (SciERC Phase 0)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 2 (left): Per-relation DR heatmap with constraint tightness (τ) annotation\"\n    analysis: |\n      Per-relation variance (0–42.4%) 比整体 DR=15.4% 更有叙事价值。引出 Claim 1 核心 insight：\n      violation rate 由 constraint tightness 驱动，非 ontology size 或 model capability。\n\n  - name: \"SciERC violation rate (schema-informed prompt)\"\n    plan_id: P002\n    description: \"Qwen3-8B SciERC, explicit constraint descriptions in prompt. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 5.78\n      DR_reduction_pct: 62.4\n      Evaluate_for_DR: 29.9\n      Evaluate_for_delta: +5.8\n      Compare_DR: 27.6\n      Feature_of_DR: 11.3\n    result_rationale: |\n      Prompt-level intervention 在统计上有效 (↓62.4%) 但 per-relation 不可靠。Evaluate-for\n      从 24.1% 升到 29.9% (+5.8pp) 是 prior-constraint conflict 的直接证据：model 学到\n      避免 Method→Task (减少 46 个违规) 但剩余 boundary cases 的 type assignment 更不稳定。\n      三个 relation 保持 >10% DR 证明 prompt 方法无法提供 per-instance guarantee。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2: Schema-informed column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      Evaluate-for regression 是整篇论文最有说服力的单个 data point：\n      prompt 不仅 insufficient 且可能 counterproductive。直接引出 decoding-time enforcement 动机。\n\n  - name: \"DocRED violation rate (minimal prompt)\"\n    plan_id: P003\n    description: \"Qwen3-8B DocRED zero-shot unconstrained. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 18.7\n      RV_pct: 28.9\n      ET_pct: 7.5\n      total_triples: 16540\n    result_rationale: |\n      96-relation DocRED DR=18.7% ≈ 7-relation SciERC DR=15.4%，14× ontology size 差异\n      未导致 violation rate 按比例增长。高 RV=28.9% 因 DocRED 使用 P-number 关系名\n      (P31_instance_of 等) 非自然语言，model 大量生成 OOV relation names。\n      ET=7.5% 因 DocRED 15 类 entity types 含 model 不熟悉的类别 (e.g., astronomical_body)。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 3: DocRED violation landscape\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      DocRED 18.7% ≈ SciERC 15.4% 是 \"tightness not size\" 的定量证据。\n      RV=28.9% 预示 grammar 层在 DocRED 上将有巨大 impact。\n\n  - name: \"DocRED violation rate (schema-informed prompt)\"\n    plan_id: P004\n    description: \"Qwen3-8B DocRED with schema-informed prompt. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 12.8\n      DR_reduction_pct: 32\n    result_rationale: |\n      Prompt ↓32% (vs SciERC ↓62%) 量化了 prompt scalability failure：96 relations 的\n      约束信息在 context window 中被 diluted，model 无法有效利用。这不是 prompt quality 问题\n      (same prompt template)，而是 ontology complexity 的固有 ceiling。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 3: Schema-informed column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      SciERC ↓62% vs DocRED ↓32% 建立 prompt intervention 的 complexity-dependent ceiling。\n      两个 data points 即足以论证趋势。\n\n  # ========== Phase 2: SciERC 4-way Ablation (ALL DONE) ==========\n  - name: \"SciERC unconstrained baseline (Phase 2)\"\n    plan_id: P005a\n    description: \"Qwen3-8B SciERC unconstrained, v2 checker. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 15.37\n      RV_pct: 1.39\n      ET_pct: 0.40\n      CF_pct: 0.08\n      R_F1: 8.23\n      E_F1: 31.01\n    result_rationale: |\n      与 P001 一致（同一 inference output, 新 checker）。CF=0.08% 是 natural baseline —— \n      unconstrained 下 model 的 type assignment 跨 relation 已基本一致。\n      CF 升高是 constrained-only 现象。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 4: SciERC ablation matrix, unconstrained column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Ablation 基准点。\"\n\n  - name: \"SciERC grammar-only\"\n    plan_id: P005\n    description: \"Qwen3-8B SciERC grammar constraints only (XGrammar CFG). 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 14.84\n      RV_pct: 0\n      ET_pct: 0\n      CF_pct: 0.08\n      R_F1: 8.23\n      E_F1: 30.98\n    result_rationale: |\n      Grammar 消灭 RV/ET (CFG 强制 vocabulary) 但 DR 基本不变 (14.84 vs 15.37)。\n      原因：domain/range 约束需要跨 field 状态信息 (entity registry)，grammar CFG 无此能力。\n      DR 微降 0.53pp 是统计噪音而非系统性效果。F1 完全不变——grammar 约束是结构性的，\n      不扭曲 probability distribution。CF=0.08% 与 unconstrained 持平，确认 CF 100%\n      由 semantic 层引入。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 4: grammar_only column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      Grammar 层功能精确：消灭 vocabulary-level violations (RV, ET)，不触及 semantic violations (DR)。\n      为 enabling dependency 论证提供 clean baseline。\n\n  - name: \"SciERC semantic-only\"\n    plan_id: P006\n    description: \"Qwen3-8B SciERC semantic constraints only (no grammar). 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 11.65\n      RV_pct: 1.51\n      ET_pct: 0.40\n      CF_pct: 2.71\n      R_F1: 8.15\n    result_rationale: |\n      Semantic layer alone 仅 ↓24% DR (vs full ↓94%)。关键机制：unconstrained generation\n      产生 ~1.5% OOV relation names → semantic layer 无法 look up 这些 relation 的 domain/range\n      → 对这些 triples 完全无效。此外，non-standard entity types (ET=0.40%) 导致 type matching\n      失败，进一步削弱 semantic enforcement。这是 enabling dependency 的直接证据：\n      grammar 是 semantic 的前提条件，非反过来。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 4: semantic_only column\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 3: DR reduction cascade diagram (unconstrained → grammar_only → semantic_only → full_s1)\"\n    analysis: |\n      24% vs 94% 的巨大 gap 是 enabling dependency 论证的核心。Semantic alone 效果差\n      不是因为 semantic layer 弱，而是因为 input 不满足 semantic layer 的前提条件。\n      这区别于简单 \"synergy\"——是 asymmetric prerequisite。\n\n  - name: \"SciERC full S1\"\n    plan_id: P007\n    description: \"Qwen3-8B SciERC full dual-layer S1 (grammar + semantic, single pass). 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 0.93\n      RV_pct: 0\n      ET_pct: 0\n      CF_pct: 9.90\n      R_F1: 8.36\n      E_F1: 30.98\n      DR_reduction_pct: 94.0\n      R_F1_delta_pp: +0.13\n      R_F1_p: 0.58\n    result_rationale: |\n      Grammar 确保每个 relation name 合法 → semantic layer 可查表执行 domain/range enforcement\n      → DR 从 15.37 降至 0.93 (↓94%)。残余 0.93% 来自 fallback events：当 semantic∩grammar\n      mask 为空集时退化为 grammar-only (该 token 位置无 semantic protection)。\n      SciERC fallback ~10.7 次/doc，远低于 DocRED ~57 次/doc，解释 SciERC 残余更低。\n      R-F1 +0.13pp (p=0.58, NS)：约束不影响 extraction quality。\n      CF 从 0.08% 跃升至 9.90%：semantic 层 per-relation 独立 type enforcement 导致\n      同一 entity 在不同 relation 中被赋予不同 type (EVR 机制)。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 4: full_s1 column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      0.93% residual + 0% RV/ET + F1-neutral 是 SciERC core result。\n      CF=9.90% 是已知 tradeoff，proactive disclosure + type ambiguity 论证 (Generic↔OtherScientificTerm)\n      + semantic-layer 消融归因 (grammar_only CF=0.08%) 构成三层防御。\n\n  - name: \"SciERC full S2 (ablation)\"\n    plan_id: P008\n    description: \"Qwen3-8B SciERC two-pass S2. 已完成。降级为 ablation。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 0.97\n      CF_pct: 8.03\n      R_F1: 8.03\n      E_F1: 31.90\n    result_rationale: |\n      S2 DR=0.97% ≈ S1 0.93%；CF=8.03% vs S1 9.90% (↓1.87pp, 不显著)；\n      R-F1=8.03% < S1 8.36% (error propagation from Pass 1)。\n      S2 不解决 CF——两种策略的 CF 差异在统计噪音内。\n      降级为 §5/appendix architectural ablation，证明框架灵活性而非优越性。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table (appendix): S1 vs S2 comparison\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      S2 data confirms S1 as recommended strategy. S2 in paper serves as:\n      (1) architectural flexibility evidence, (2) confirmation CF is inherent (not S1-specific).\n\n  # ========== Phase 2: DocRED 4-way Ablation (ALL DONE) ==========\n  - name: \"DocRED unconstrained baseline\"\n    plan_id: P009\n    description: \"Qwen3-8B DocRED unconstrained, v2 checker. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 18.46\n      RV_pct: 29.66\n      ET_pct: 2.48\n      CF_pct: 0.10\n      R_F1: 7.74\n      E_F1: 58.15\n      total_triples: 17497\n      unrecognized_relations: 5189\n    result_rationale: |\n      5189 个 OOV relation predictions (29.66%) 是 Qwen 在 DocRED 96-type schema 上的\n      主要 failure mode。这些 OOV predictions 在 all_set F1 method 下计入 FP denominator，\n      压低 precision/F1。Grammar 层消灭 OOV 后将直接提升 F1。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 5: DocRED ablation matrix, unconstrained column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"High RV baseline is key to understanding DocRED dynamics.\"\n\n  - name: \"DocRED grammar-only\"\n    plan_id: P010\n    description: \"Qwen3-8B DocRED grammar-only. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 26.17\n      RV_pct: 0.03\n      ET_pct: 0\n      CF_pct: 0.07\n      R_F1: 8.31\n      E_F1: 59.38\n    result_rationale: |\n      DR 从 18.46% 上升到 26.17% (+7.71pp)——latent violation surfacing effect。\n      机制：grammar 将 5189 个 OOV predictions 强制映射到 96 个合法 relation names →\n      这些 triple 现在可被 DR checker 检测 → 暴露大量原本隐藏在 OOV 背后的 domain/range\n      违规。这是比简单 \"grammar reduces violations\" 更深的 insight。\n      E-F1 从 58.15 升至 59.38 (+1.23pp)：grammar 消灭 ET violations (OOV entity types\n      计为 FP → E-F1 上升)。Grammar 是 F1 提升的唯一来源 (full_s1 E-F1=59.37 ≈ 59.38)。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 5: grammar_only column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      Latent violation surfacing 是 D014 的经验基础：同一 ontology tightness 下，\n      model RV baseline 决定 grammar 层暴露多少 latent DR → 决定 full_s1 residual DR 上限。\n      这个 finding 超出 \"grammar helps\" 的 trivial expectation。\n\n  - name: \"DocRED semantic-only\"\n    plan_id: P011\n    description: \"Qwen3-8B DocRED semantic-only. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 13.84\n      RV_pct: 29.87\n      ET_pct: 4.22\n      CF_pct: 1.05\n      R_F1: 7.70\n    result_rationale: |\n      与 SciERC 同样的 enabling dependency pattern：RV=29.87% 持续 → semantic layer\n      对 ~30% triples 无能力 → DR 仅 ↓25%。ET 上升到 4.22% (vs unconstrained 2.48%)\n      是补偿效应：semantic masking 压力下 model 转向生成非标准 entity types。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 5: semantic_only column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Confirms enabling dependency on 96-relation schema — same mechanism as SciERC.\"\n\n  - name: \"DocRED full S1\"\n    plan_id: P012\n    description: \"Qwen3-8B DocRED full S1. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 10.21\n      RV_pct: 0.03\n      ET_pct: 0\n      CF_pct: 2.57\n      R_F1: 8.23\n      E_F1: 59.37\n      DR_reduction_pct: 44.7\n      R_F1_delta_pp: +0.50\n      R_F1_p: \"<0.001\"\n      E_F1_delta_pp: +1.22\n      E_F1_p: \"<0.001\"\n      fallback_events_per_doc: 57\n    result_rationale: |\n      DR↓45% (vs SciERC ↓94%) 不是方法失败而是 D014 dual-factor 的预测结果：\n      DocRED τ̄=0.842 (tight) × Qwen RV=29.66% (high) → grammar surfacing 暴露大量 latent DR\n      → residual 10.21%。Fallback ~57 次/doc (vs SciERC ~10.7) 量化了 constraint coverage gap。\n      R-F1 +0.50pp (p<0.001) 显著正向：OOV relation names 被强制匹配合法名 → 部分原本被计为 FP\n      的 predictions 变为 TP → precision ↑。这是 grammar 层的 secondary benefit。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 5: full_s1 column\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 4: tightness × RV baseline interaction plot (4 model-dataset combinations)\"\n    analysis: |\n      10.21% residual + 45% reduction 在 paper 中不作为 weakness 而是作为 D014 tightness×RV\n      interaction finding 的经验支撑。Fallback frequency (57/doc) 定义 \"Constraint Coverage\"\n      metric，把残余 DR 从 unexplained gap 变成 quantifiable phenomenon。\n\n  # ========== Cross-Model Validation (ALL DONE) ==========\n  - name: \"Llama SciERC unconstrained\"\n    plan_id: P013\n    description: \"Llama-3.1-8B SciERC unconstrained. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 13.34\n      RV_pct: 0.55\n      ET_pct: 0\n      R_F1: 2.68\n      E_F1: 23.56\n    result_rationale: |\n      Llama violation profile 不同于 Qwen：RV 更低 (0.55% vs 1.39%)，DR 略低 (13.34% vs 15.37%)。\n      低 RV 意味着 grammar 层 latent surfacing 更少 → 预测 constrained DR 将显著低于 Qwen。\n      R-F1=2.68% (vs Qwen 8.23%) 反映 Llama-8B 在 SciERC zero-shot 上 extraction quality 较差，\n      但 F1 是控制变量不是优化目标。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 6: Cross-model matrix\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      Llama 低 RV + 中 DR vs Qwen 中 RV + 中 DR → RV↓DR↑ orthogonality 的起点。\n      两层约束解决正交 failure modes。\n\n  - name: \"Llama SciERC full S1\"\n    plan_id: P014\n    description: \"Llama-3.1-8B SciERC full S1, zero code modification. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 0.08\n      DR_reduction_pct: 99.4\n      RV_pct: 0\n      ET_pct: 0\n      CF_pct: 6.56\n      R_F1: 2.54\n      R_F1_delta_pp: -0.14\n      R_F1_p: 0.011\n    result_rationale: |\n      ↓99.4% 因 Llama 低 RV (0.55%) → grammar surfacing minimal → semantic layer 几乎对所有\n      triples 生效。DR=0.08% (仅 1 个违规) 实质上为零。R-F1 -0.14pp (p=0.011) 虽统计显著\n      但绝对值可忽略 (-0.14 out of 2.68, <1% relative change)。\n      CF=6.56% 高于 Qwen SciERC (9.90%) 的 per-entity rate 但方向一致——non-local constraint\n      问题在 Llama 上更突出。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 6: Llama SciERC full_s1 column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      99.4% DR reduction 零代码修改是 cross-model 的 headline。\"Generalizes across model families\n      without code modification\" 是程序性事实 (iron-clad claim)。\n\n  - name: \"Llama DocRED unconstrained\"\n    plan_id: P015\n    description: \"Llama-3.1-8B DocRED unconstrained. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 26.07\n      RV_pct: 16.03\n      ET_pct: 0.13\n      CF_pct: 0.17\n      R_F1: 5.98\n      E_F1: 55.65\n    result_rationale: |\n      Llama DocRED: RV=16.03% (vs Qwen 29.66%) 但 DR=26.07% (vs Qwen 18.46%)。\n      RV↓DR↑ 反向于 Qwen——vocabulary compliance ≠ semantic compliance 的直接证据。\n      Llama 更擅长记忆 P-number relation names (fewer OOV) 但对 domain/range 语义约束\n      理解更差 (more violations in valid relations)。这是 §5 cross-model independent finding。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 6: Llama DocRED unconstrained column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      RV↓DR↑ orthogonality: Llama 和 Qwen 在 DocRED 上失败模式正交 →\n      两层约束分别处理各自的 failure mode → 架构论证更有力。\n\n  - name: \"Llama DocRED full S1\"\n    plan_id: P016\n    description: \"Llama-3.1-8B DocRED full S1. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 2.55\n      DR_reduction_pct: 90.2\n      RV_pct: 0\n      ET_pct: 0\n      CF_pct: 12.02\n      R_F1: 6.27\n      R_F1_delta_pp: +0.29\n      R_F1_p: 0.013\n      E_F1: 55.01\n      E_F1_delta_pp: -0.64\n      parse_failures: 91\n    result_rationale: |\n      Llama DocRED ↓90.2% (vs Qwen 同 dataset ↓44.7%)——D014 dual-factor 的最强证据：\n      同一 ontology (τ̄=0.842) 但 Llama RV=16.03% << Qwen 29.66%，\n      grammar surfacing 更少 → residual DR 更低 (2.55% vs 10.21%)。\n      R-F1 +0.29pp (p=0.013) 正向且显著 (two models both positive on DocRED)。\n      CF=12.02% 高于 Qwen (2.57%)——model-dependent CF variation。\n      Parse failures 91/998 (9.1%) vs unconstrained 68 (6.8%)——constrained decoding\n      增加约束 token 导致 max_tokens 不足的概率上升。偏差方向保守 (不利于 constrained)。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 6: Llama DocRED full_s1 column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      Llama 90.2% vs Qwen 44.7% 在同一 dataset 上是 D014 的决定性证据。\n      Two data points fully explained by tightness × RV baseline model。\n      Paper 中应在 §5 展开 dual-factor analysis 并呈现 4-point interaction plot。\n\n  # ========== Supplementary (ALL DONE) ==========\n  - name: \"S2 pilot (50 docs)\"\n    plan_id: P017\n    description: \"S2 pilot run on 50 SciERC docs. 已完成，被 P008 full run superseded。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 2.05\n      R_F1: 10.08\n      samples: 50\n    result_rationale: |\n      小样本 pilot 确认 S2 可运行，但 DR=2.05% (n=146 triples) 是高方差估计。\n      Full run P008 (n=1644 triples) DR=0.97% 是可靠值。不在论文中引用 pilot 数字。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Superseded by P008. Do not cite pilot50 DR=0% (原始 dryrun artifact)。\"\n\n  - name: \"Post-hoc filtering baseline\"\n    plan_id: P018\n    description: \"Post-hoc filtering on Qwen SciERC + DocRED. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      scierc_R_F1_posthoc: 8.63\n      scierc_R_F1_OntoCoDec: 8.36\n      scierc_reject_pct: 16.8\n      scierc_TP_lost: 7\n      docred_R_F1_posthoc: 9.61\n      docred_R_F1_OntoCoDec: 8.23\n      docred_reject_pct: 48.1\n      docred_TP_lost: 127\n      docred_ET_residual: 2.47\n    result_rationale: |\n      Post-hoc F1 > OntoCoDec F1 (SciERC 8.63 vs 8.36, DocRED 9.61 vs 8.23)，因 low-F1\n      regime 下删除 violating triples (大部分是 FP) 大幅提升 precision。\n      但 DocRED 丢弃 48.1% triples + 127 个 TP (11.2%)。\n      Framing: multi-dimensional (recall ↑ vs ↓, coverage, operational, ET residual)。\n      Post-hoc 无法解决 ET (残余 2.47%) 因它只删 triples 不改 entity list。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 7: OntoCoDec vs post-hoc multi-dimensional comparison\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      不以 F1 论高低。OntoCoDec recall 上升 + post-hoc recall 下降是核心论据。\n      127 个 lost TP 是 \"prevent vs detect\" 最具体的数据点。\n\n  - name: \"Bootstrap CI (10000 iterations)\"\n    plan_id: P019\n    description: \"Bootstrap CI for all F1 metrics. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_scierc_R_F1_delta: +0.13\n      qwen_scierc_R_F1_p: 0.58\n      qwen_docred_R_F1_delta: +0.50\n      qwen_docred_R_F1_p: \"<0.001\"\n      qwen_docred_R_F1_CI: \"[+0.23, +0.81]\"\n      qwen_docred_E_F1_delta: +1.23\n      qwen_docred_E_F1_p: \"<0.001\"\n      llama_scierc_R_F1_delta: -0.14\n      llama_scierc_R_F1_p: 0.011\n      llama_docred_R_F1_delta: +0.29\n      llama_docred_R_F1_p: 0.013\n    result_rationale: |\n      DocRED R-F1 显著提升 (both models p<0.02) 因 OOV elimination reduces FP。\n      SciERC R-F1 中性/可忽略 (Qwen NS, Llama borderline) 因 SciERC RV baseline 低，\n      grammar 层 FP reduction 效果有限。\n      Cross-model pattern: DocRED F1 positive (both), SciERC F1 neutral — consistent story。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table (appendix): Full bootstrap CI table\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Statistical rigor layer. All p-values reported in paper.\"\n\n  # ========== WikiEvents Event Extraction (D040, ALL DONE except post-hoc computed) ==========\n  - name: \"WikiEvents Qwen3-8B unconstrained\"\n    plan_id: P021\n    description: \"WikiEvents EE, Qwen3-8B unconstrained. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      parse_rate_pct: 88.6\n      EV_pct: 24.0\n      RoV_pct: 74.9\n      AC_pct: 0.3\n      CF_pct: 0\n      trigger_F1: 11.84\n      entity_F1: 0\n      argument_F1: 0.09\n    result_rationale: |\n      RoV=74.9% 是压倒性违规——EE 的 80 argument roles conditioned on 56 event types\n      远超 model 从 prompt 学习的容量。EV=24% 因生成非 KAIROS event types。\n      Entity F1=0% 不是 model 无能力——是 unconstrained JSON 格式太 malformed，\n      parser 无法提取 entity mentions。AC=0.3% 极低因大部分 triples 都被 RoV 覆盖\n      (invalid role → 无法检查 argument type constraint)。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 8: WikiEvents 3-model results\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      RoV 74.9% (EE) vs RV 1.4% (RE SciERC) 是最直观的 \"EE needs constraint more than RE\" evidence。\n      Entity F1=0%→constrained 14.1% 是 format compliance recovery 的 dramatic demonstration。\n\n  - name: \"WikiEvents Qwen3-8B constrained (full_s1 v3)\"\n    plan_id: P022\n    description: \"WikiEvents EE, Qwen3-8B, full S1, collision+exact-match fix. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      parse_rate_pct: 83.7\n      EV_pct: 0\n      RoV_pct: 0\n      AC_pct: 2.1\n      CF_pct: 21.1\n      trigger_F1: 13.39\n      entity_F1: 14.09\n      argument_F1: 1.68\n    result_rationale: |\n      三层级联 Grammar→RoV→AC：grammar 消灭 EV→0% (CFG 强制 56 event types)；\n      semantic continuation masking 消灭 RoV→0% (80 roles per-event-type enforcement)；\n      AC=2.1% 残余来自 model 语义混淆 (SID vs SEN 等相近 entity types，non-collision related\n      因 Qwen 0 collision groups)。\n      Entity F1 从 0%→14.1%：纯粹 format compliance recovery——grammar 产生 schema-valid JSON，\n      parser 才能识别 entity mentions。不是语义改进。\n      CF=21.1% 高于 RE (9.9% SciERC)：EE argument structure 更复杂 (多个 event 共享 entity，\n      每个 event 独立 type assignment)，CF tradeoff 更明显。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 8: Qwen constrained column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      EV/RoV→0% across all 3 models 是 cross-task generalization 的核心证据。\n      三层级联 (Grammar→RoV→AC) 比 RE 两层 (Grammar→DR) 更丰富——architecture contribution 更强。\n\n  - name: \"WikiEvents Llama-3.1-8B unconstrained\"\n    plan_id: P023\n    description: \"WikiEvents EE, Llama-3.1-8B unconstrained. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      parse_rate_pct: 91.9\n      EV_pct: 10.5\n      RoV_pct: 88.8\n      AC_pct: 0.1\n      CF_pct: 0\n      trigger_F1: 5.72\n      entity_F1: 0\n    result_rationale: |\n      Llama RoV=88.8% (highest across all experiments)——对 role vocabulary 的记忆最差。\n      但 EV=10.5% (lowest among 3 models)——对 event type vocabulary 记忆更好。\n      这与 RE 中 Llama 低 RV 但高 DR 的模式一致：vocabulary-level vs semantic-level\n      failure 因 model 而异。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 8: Llama unconstrained column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"RoV=88.8% is the highest violation rate in the paper — strongest evidence for constraint necessity.\"\n\n  - name: \"WikiEvents Llama-3.1-8B constrained (full_s1 v3)\"\n    plan_id: P024\n    description: \"WikiEvents EE, Llama-3.1-8B, full S1 v3. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      parse_rate_pct: 84.1\n      EV_pct: 0\n      RoV_pct: 0\n      AC_pct: 3.8\n      CF_pct: 17.2\n      trigger_F1: 7.48\n      entity_F1: 17.63\n    result_rationale: |\n      Pattern 与 Qwen 一致：EV/RoV→0%，AC 残余 3.8% (略高于 Qwen 2.1%)。\n      Llama AC 稍高因对 KAIROS entity types 的 semantic understanding 略弱\n      (但无 BPE collision 问题——Llama 0 collision groups)。\n      Entity F1=17.6% (highest among 3 models)：Llama entity mention 质量更好\n      (当 format valid 时)。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 8: Llama constrained column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Cross-model consistency: EV/RoV→0% regardless of model. AC varies 2.1-3.8%.\"\n\n  - name: \"WikiEvents Mistral-7B unconstrained\"\n    plan_id: P025\n    description: \"WikiEvents EE, Mistral-7B-v0.3 unconstrained. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      parse_rate_pct: 78.9\n      EV_pct: 37.3\n      RoV_pct: 63.9\n      AC_pct: 0\n      CF_pct: 0\n      trigger_F1: 2.41\n      entity_F1: 0\n    result_rationale: |\n      Mistral EV=37.3% (highest)——最弱的 event type vocabulary 学习能力。\n      RoV=63.9% (lowest of 3, but still dominant)。AC=0% 因 37.3% invalid event types\n      使大量 triples 无法进行 argument constraint check。\n      Parse rate=78.9% (lowest) 反映 Mistral 在 complex JSON generation 上最弱。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 8: Mistral unconstrained column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Mistral's high EV (37.3%) means grammar layer eliminates 37.3% vocabulary violations for this model.\"\n\n  - name: \"WikiEvents Mistral-7B constrained (full_s1 v3)\"\n    plan_id: P026\n    description: \"WikiEvents EE, Mistral-7B, full S1 v3 with collision fix. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      parse_rate_pct: 88.6\n      EV_pct: 0\n      RoV_pct: 0\n      AC_pct: 1.3\n      CF_pct: 14.9\n      trigger_F1: 3.87\n      entity_F1: 11.71\n    result_rationale: |\n      EV/RoV→0% consistent across all 3 models。AC=1.3% (lowest) after collision fix\n      (v3 resolves SID/SEN/SIDE→'S' and BAL/BOD→'B' collisions)。\n      Parse rate 从 78.9%→88.6% 因 grammar 产生 well-formed JSON。\n      AC 残余 1.3% 是 pure semantic confusion (non-collision, 因 Mistral 有 2 collision groups\n      但 v3 已修复大部分——从 v2 16.6% 降至 v3 1.3%)。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 8: Mistral constrained column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      3-model consistency on EV/RoV→0% 是 task-agnostic effectiveness 的决定性证据。\n      AC range 1.3-3.8% 反映 model-specific semantic confusion, not method limitation。\n\n  - name: \"WikiEvents Mistral grammar_only v3\"\n    plan_id: P027\n    description: \"Grammar-only ablation on Mistral WikiEvents. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      EV_pct: 0\n      RoV_pct: 64.0\n      AC_pct: 13.8\n      CF_pct: 1.1\n    result_rationale: |\n      Grammar 消灭 EV→0% 但 RoV=64% 持续——grammar CFG 无法 encode per-event-type\n      role constraints (role validity 取决于 event context, 非 static vocabulary)。\n      AC 从 0%→13.8% 是 latent surfacing (同 RE DocRED grammar-only DR rise)：\n      grammar 强制有效 event types 后暴露原本隐藏的 role→entity type 违规。\n      Proves: semantic layer is essential for EE，two-layer architecture is necessary not convenient。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 9: EE ablation (grammar_only vs full_s1)\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      grammar_only RoV=64% vs full RoV=0% 是 semantic layer necessity 的单一最强证据。\n      比 RE 更 dramatic (RE grammar_only DR=14.84%, full DR=0.93%, 差距 14pp；EE 差距 64pp)。\n\n  - name: \"WikiEvents EE post-hoc filtering (3 models)\"\n    plan_id: P028\n    description: \"Post-hoc filtering baseline for EE. 从现有数据计算得出。\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_args_before: 5467\n      qwen_args_after: 23\n      qwen_discard_pct: 99.6\n      llama_args_before: 5053\n      llama_args_after: 3\n      llama_discard_pct: 99.9\n      mistral_args_before: 6034\n      mistral_args_after: 0\n      mistral_discard_pct: 100\n    result_rationale: |\n      EE 的极高 violation rate (RoV 64-89%) 意味着 post-hoc 必须删除几乎所有 arguments。\n      Qwen: 5467→23 (99.6%)，因 RoV=74.9% + EV=24% 导致绝大部分 arguments 违规。\n      Llama: 5053→3 (99.9%)，RoV=88.8% 更高 → 更少幸存。\n      Mistral: 6034→0 (100%)，EV=37.3% + RoV=63.9% 的组合使零 argument 完全合规。\n      对比 RE post-hoc (SciERC 16.8%, DocRED 48.1%)——EE 的 constraint space 使 post-hoc\n      从 \"expensive but functional\" 变成 \"completely non-viable\"。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 10: Post-hoc comparison RE vs EE\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 5: Post-hoc rejection rate bar chart (RE 2 datasets × EE, 3 models)\"\n    analysis: |\n      99.6-100% discard 是 killer comparison。审稿人 \"why not just post-hoc filter?\" 被\n      one number 消灭。EE post-hoc non-viability vs RE post-hoc partial viability\n      也展示了 constraint space complexity 的 monotonic effect。\n\n  # ========== 70B Scale Experiments (P029 DONE, P030 RUNNING) ==========\n  - name: \"70B SciERC unconstrained + constrained\"\n    plan_id: P029\n    description: \"Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct AWQ-INT4, SciERC. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      unconstrained_DR_pct: 6.5\n      unconstrained_RV_pct: 0.6\n      unconstrained_ET_pct: 0\n      unconstrained_R_F1: 11.22\n      unconstrained_E_F1: 35.17\n      constrained_DR_pct: 0\n      constrained_RV_pct: 0\n      constrained_ET_pct: 0\n      constrained_CF_pct: 3.66\n      constrained_R_F1: 11.24\n      constrained_E_F1: 35.14\n      DR_reduction_pct: 100\n      R_F1_delta_pp: +0.02\n    result_rationale: |\n      70B SciERC unconstrained DR=6.5%——是 8B 的约一半 (Qwen 15.4%, Llama 13.3%)。\n      Scale 减少违规但未消除：每 15 个 triple 仍有 1 个违反 type constraint。\n      这彻底否定 \"scale solves it\" 反驳 (7-relation 小 ontology 上 70B 仍有 6.5% DR)。\n      Constrained DR=0%：SciERC 7-relation schema 足够简单，70B + OntoCoDec = 完美消除。\n      R-F1 +0.02pp (neutral)。CF=3.66% 低于 8B (Qwen 9.90%, Llama 6.56%)——\n      70B 的 type assignment 更稳定，cross-relation consistency 更好。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 11: 70B cross-scale results\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 6: DR across scales (8B×3 + 70B) for SciERC\"\n    analysis: |\n      6.5% at 70B 是 §1 motivation 的经验支撑：即使参数扩大 9×，violations 持续。\n      Constrained DR=0% 确认 OntoCoDec 在 70B 上不仅有效而且 perfect。\n      CF=3.66% (lowest across all models) 暗示 scale 可以缓解 CF tradeoff。\n\n  - name: \"70B DocRED unconstrained + constrained\"\n    plan_id: P030\n    description: \"Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct AWQ-INT4, DocRED. 当前 RUNNING。\"\n    expected_results:\n      unconstrained_DR_pct: 11.0\n      unconstrained_RV_pct: 5.2\n      unconstrained_ET_pct: 0.05\n      unconstrained_CF_pct: 0.12\n      unconstrained_R_F1: 9.8\n      unconstrained_E_F1: 62.5\n      unconstrained_parse_fail_pct: 2.0\n      unconstrained_total_triples: 17500\n      constrained_DR_pct: 1.2\n      constrained_RV_pct: 0\n      constrained_ET_pct: 0\n      constrained_CF_pct: 5.0\n      constrained_R_F1: 10.1\n      constrained_E_F1: 63.0\n      constrained_parse_fail_pct: 3.5\n      DR_reduction_pct: 89.1\n      R_F1_delta_pp: +0.3\n      E_F1_delta_pp: +0.5\n    result_rationale: |\n      === Unconstrained DR ~11% 预测逻辑 ===\n      (1) Scale effect calibration: 70B SciERC DR=6.5% = 8B-Llama SciERC 13.3% × 0.49。\n          8B-Llama DocRED DR=26.07% × 0.49 ≈ 12.8%。但 DocRED tight constraints\n          (τ̄=0.842) 对 scale benefit 有 ceiling——tight-constraint relations\n          (P31_instance_of DR=60%, P1001 DR=44%) 即使 70B 仍难以纠正。\n      (2) Model-family consistency: 70B 是 Llama 家族，DocRED 上 8B-Llama DR=26.07%\n          (highest among 8B models)。Scale 减半但 DocRED 的绝对 floor 更高。\n      (3) 预测 ~11% 落在 best tier [8, 15]：足以否定 \"scale solves it\"\n          (每 9 个 triple 仍有 1 个违规)，同时不太高以至于暗示 \"70B 完全无改善\"。\n\n      === RV ~5.2% ===\n      70B 对 96 relation P-number names 记忆力远优于 8B (Qwen 29.7%, Llama 16%)，\n      但 P-number 是非自然语言标识符，even 70B 会偶尔 OOV。预测 ~5%：\n      8B-Llama RV=16% × 0.33 (scale improvement ratio higher for vocabulary than semantics)。\n\n      === Constrained DR ~1.2% ===\n      (1) Llama-8B DocRED constrained DR=2.55% with RV=16.03%。\n      (2) 70B RV ~5.2% → grammar surfacing 更少 (fewer OOV → fewer latent violations exposed)。\n      (3) 70B semantic understanding 更强 → semantic mask 决策更准确 → fewer fallback events。\n      (4) 8B-Llama SciERC: unconstrained 13.3→constrained 0.08% (↓99.4%)。\n          8B-Llama DocRED: 26.07→2.55% (↓90.2%)。\n          70B DocRED: 11→1.2% (↓89.1%)——与 8B-Llama DocRED 同量级 reduction，\n          略低因 70B 的 lower RV baseline 意味着 residual DR 更多来自 genuinely hard cases\n          (tight constraints + model semantic confusion) 而非 latent surfacing。\n      (5) 1.2% 落在 best tier [0.5, 2.0]。\n\n      === DR reduction ~89% ===\n      在 best tier [85, 95]。Not as high as 8B-Llama SciERC 99.4% 因 DocRED \n      tightness ceiling (同 D014 analysis)。\n\n      === R-F1 +0.3pp ===\n      与 8B-Llama DocRED +0.29pp 一致——OOV elimination 带来的 precision gain。\n      在 best tier [-0.3, 0.5]。\n\n      === CF ~5% ===\n      低于 8B-Llama DocRED (12.02%) 因 70B type assignment 更稳定。\n      高于 70B SciERC (3.66%) 因 DocRED 96-type schema 更复杂。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 11: 70B DocRED column\"\n      - \"Table 12: Cross-scale summary (8B→70B, 2 datasets, 4 metrics)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 6 (right): DR across scales for DocRED — 4-point curve (3×8B + 1×70B)\"\n      - \"Figure 7: 2D plot: scale (x) vs DR (y), SciERC and DocRED as two curves — shows ceiling effect on DocRED\"\n    analysis: |\n      70B DocRED 完成 cross-scale × cross-dataset 矩阵的最后一个 cell：\n      \n      |           | SciERC (τ̄=0.40) | DocRED (τ̄=0.84) |\n      |-----------|-----------------|-----------------|\n      | 8B uncon  | 13.3-15.4%      | 18.5-26.1%      |\n      | 8B con    | 0-0.93%         | 2.55-10.21%     |\n      | 70B uncon | 6.5%            | ~11%            |\n      | 70B con   | 0%              | ~1.2%           |\n      \n      Three findings from this matrix:\n      (1) Scale halves violations but doesn't eliminate them (row comparison)\n      (2) Tightness creates ceiling for both unconstrained and constrained DR (column comparison)\n      (3) OntoCoDec is effective across both scales (8B reduction 90-99%, 70B reduction 89-100%)\n      \n      Combined with WikiEvents cross-task data, this gives:\n      2 tasks × 4 models × 3 datasets = complete evidence matrix for \"universal framework\" claim。\n\n  # ========== Error Analysis (PLANNED) ==========\n  - name: \"Error analysis / case study\"\n    plan_id: P031\n    description: \"10-20 representative cases from v3 EE results + RE residual analysis\"\n    expected_results:\n      ee_ac_residual_total: 35\n      ac_semantic_confusion_pct: 72\n      ac_collision_residual_pct: 12\n      ac_boundary_case_pct: 16\n      cf_evr_dominated_pct: 88\n      cf_type_ambiguity_examples: 5\n      re_docred_residual_dr_tight_relation_pct: 80\n      representative_cases: 15\n    result_rationale: |\n      AC residual (2-4%) 预测根因分布：\n      (1) ~72% semantic confusion：model 混淆语义相近 entity types (SID vs SEN = \"side\" vs\n          \"sentence\"，PER vs GPE = 人名 vs 地名 in ambiguous contexts)。\n          这些是 genuine 语义 boundary cases, 非 tokenizer/engineering 问题。\n      (2) ~12% BPE collision 残余：Mistral 的 2 collision groups (S-prefix, B-prefix)\n          v3 修复后仍有少量 edge cases (multi-token entity types where first token disambiguates\n          but model hasn't fully adapted to new constraint)。\n      (3) ~16% 真正 boundary cases：annotation-disagreement-level ambiguity，\n          即人类标注者也可能不同意的 type assignment。这类错误不可能消除。\n\n      CF root cause (15-21%)：>88% 是 EVR (entity-vs-relation type drift)——\n      同一 entity 在 entity list 中的 type 与 relation argument 中的 type 不一致。\n      这是 per-relation 独立 type enforcement 的直接后果。\n      Top 冲突模式将平行 RE SciERC 的 Generic↔OtherScientificTerm pattern，\n      但 EE 中是 PER↔SID、LOC↔GPE 等更细粒度的混淆。\n\n      Case study 将提供 5 个 CF type ambiguity examples，让审稿人直观理解\n      \"CF 是 type system 语义边界模糊的体现，非方法 bug\"。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure (appendix): 3-panel error case illustration (AC semantic confusion, CF type ambiguity, boundary case)\"\n    analysis: |\n      Case study 的论文功能：(1) 为 AC residual 提供 qualitative evidence 支撑\n      \"inherent model semantic confusion\" framing; (2) 为 CF 提供 \"type system ambiguity\"\n      的具体 examples; (3) 展示 OntoCoDec 的 debugging 价值——约束让 violation pattern\n      变得可分析 (unconstrained 的 >70% RoV 掩盖了所有细粒度 pattern)。\n\n  # ========== D049 Tier 2 (PLANNED) ==========\n  - name: \"EE FT composability\"\n    plan_id: P032\n    description: \"Fine-tuned model + OntoCoDec on WikiEvents EE. Priority 2, 时间紧。\"\n    expected_results:\n      ft_unconstrained_trigger_F1: 42\n      ft_unconstrained_argument_F1: 22\n      ft_unconstrained_entity_F1: 55\n      ft_unconstrained_EV_pct: 0.5\n      ft_unconstrained_RoV_pct: 3.0\n      ft_unconstrained_AC_pct: 1.8\n      ft_constrained_trigger_F1: 42\n      ft_constrained_argument_F1: 22.3\n      ft_constrained_entity_F1: 55\n      ft_constrained_EV_pct: 0\n      ft_constrained_RoV_pct: 0\n      ft_constrained_AC_pct: 0.2\n      ft_constrained_CF_pct: 2.5\n      delta_arg_F1_pp: +0.3\n    result_rationale: |\n      RE FT composability 已确认：4 个 FT 实验 (Qwen/Llama × SciERC/DocRED)\n      均显示 DR reduction + F1 neutral/positive。\n      EE FT 预期类似 pattern：\n      (1) FT 大幅提升 F1 (zero-shot trigger ~12% → FT ~42%, argument ~0% → ~22%)。\n      (2) FT 后 violations 大幅降低但不归零：RoV 从 75-89% 降至 ~3%\n          (FT learns role vocabulary but still makes occasional errors)。\n          AC 从 ~0.3% 升至 ~1.8% (FT 产生更多 valid role assignments → 更多可被 AC check 覆盖)。\n      (3) Constrained 后 RoV→0%, AC→0.2%, F1 neutral (+0.3pp)。\n      (4) CF ~2.5% (远低于 zero-shot 15-21%) 因 FT 稳定了 type assignment。\n\n      如果 ~30 GPU-hours budget 不够或时间不足 (May 25 deadline)：\n      RE FT 4 实验 + EE zero-shot 3 实验已足够支撑 \"composability\" claim。\n      P032 是 bonus evidence，非 critical path。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table (appendix): FT+OntoCoDec composability (RE 4 experiments + EE 1 experiment)\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      FT composability 回应 \"only works in zero-shot?\" 潜在质疑。\n      RE 数据已充分 (4/4 positive)；EE FT 是 completeness bonus。\n      即使 skip P032，论文仍可声明 \"composable with fine-tuned models (verified on RE)\"。\n\n  # ========== D049 Tier 3 (PLANNED) ==========\n  - name: \"Grammar-only cross-model validation (Qwen/Llama EE)\"\n    plan_id: P033\n    description: \"Grammar-only ablation on Qwen and Llama WikiEvents for completeness\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_grammar_only_EV: 0\n      qwen_grammar_only_RoV: 68\n      qwen_grammar_only_AC: 11\n      qwen_grammar_only_CF: 0.5\n      llama_grammar_only_EV: 0\n      llama_grammar_only_RoV: 76\n      llama_grammar_only_AC: 14\n      llama_grammar_only_CF: 0.3\n    result_rationale: |\n      Mistral grammar-only 已确认 pattern (RoV=64%, AC=13.8%)。\n      Qwen/Llama 预测 RoV 67-77%：\n      - Qwen unconstrained RoV=74.9% → grammar-only 应稍降 (grammar 强制 valid event types\n        改变生成 context → 可能略影响 role generation) → ~68%。\n      - Llama unconstrained RoV=88.8% → grammar-only ~76% (比 Qwen 高因 baseline 更高)。\n      AC 上升到 11-14% (latent surfacing: grammar 强制 valid event types → 更多 triples\n      可被 AC checker 检测 → 暴露 latent argument type violations)。\n      \n      Priority 3：Mistral 单模型 ablation 已足够支撑 \"semantic layer essential for EE\"。\n      3 模型一致性增加 robustness 但非 critical。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table (appendix): EE grammar-only ablation (3 models)\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      3-model grammar-only consistency: EV→0% (grammar works), RoV stays 64-77% (grammar insufficient),\n      AC rises (latent surfacing). Same pattern across models strengthens claim。\n\n  - name: \"Bootstrap CI for EE metrics\"\n    plan_id: P034\n    description: \"10000-iteration bootstrap CI for EE F1 changes\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_entity_F1_delta: +14.09\n      qwen_entity_F1_p: \"<0.001\"\n      qwen_trigger_F1_delta: +1.55\n      qwen_trigger_F1_p: 0.015\n      llama_entity_F1_delta: +17.63\n      llama_entity_F1_p: \"<0.001\"\n      llama_trigger_F1_delta: +1.76\n      llama_trigger_F1_p: 0.03\n      mistral_entity_F1_delta: +11.71\n      mistral_entity_F1_p: \"<0.001\"\n      mistral_trigger_F1_delta: +1.46\n      mistral_trigger_F1_p: 0.05\n    result_rationale: |\n      Entity F1 从 0→11-18% 的 recovery 必然高度显著 (p≪0.001)——\n      变化量远大于 bootstrap variance (binomial CI at 246 docs is narrow)。\n      Trigger F1 +1.5-1.8pp 在 borderline significant：\n      246 docs 的 bootstrap CI width ~±1pp，+1.5pp 勉强超出但 p 在 0.01-0.05 之间。\n      Argument F1 changes 太小 (<2pp absolute on near-zero baseline) → 可能 NS。\n      \n      Priority 3：Entity F1 significance 是 guaranteed (trivial to prove)；\n      trigger F1 significance 是 borderline (nice-to-have)；\n      argument F1 significance 无关紧要 (near-zero baseline)。\n      不影响 core claims (mechanism generalization 是 contribution, not SOTA F1)。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table (appendix): Bootstrap CI for EE metrics (3 models × 3 metrics)\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      Statistical rigor layer for EE. Entity F1 recovery significance is guaranteed.\n      对 acceptance decision 影响小但增加 soundness perception。\n\n  - name: \"Latency overhead measurement\"\n    plan_id: P035\n    description: \"Wall-clock latency comparison. SciERC 已完成, DocRED RUNNING。\"\n    expected_results:\n      scierc_overhead_pct: 13.1\n      scierc_mean_unconstrained_s: 4.16\n      scierc_mean_constrained_s: 4.71\n      docred_overhead_pct: 17.5\n      docred_mean_unconstrained_s: 23.5\n      docred_mean_constrained_s: 27.6\n      ee_overhead_pct_estimated: 20\n    result_rationale: |\n      SciERC 已测 13.1% overhead (4.16s→4.71s, 7-relation schema)。\n      DocRED 预测 ~17.5%：\n      (1) 96 relations → semantic mask lookup 需遍历更多 type rules per token。\n      (2) 更多 fallback events (~57/doc vs ~10.7/doc) → fallback handling overhead。\n      (3) 但 mask computation 是 O(|R|) per token, |R|=96 vs 7 = 13.7× more lookups，\n          而 mask computation 仅占总 inference time 的 ~10% → overhead 增量有限。\n      (4) 预测 17-18%，仍 <20%。\n\n      EE 估计 ~20%：56 event types × 80 roles × 27 entity types 的三层 mask\n      (RE 只有 grammar→semantic 两层，EE 有 grammar→role→argument 三层)\n      但 token generation 仍是瓶颈，mask computation 占比小。\n\n      总体 framing：<25% overhead for guaranteed type compliance。\n      相比 post-hoc filtering 需额外 pipeline + 人工审查的成本，微不足道。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table (appendix): Latency overhead (SciERC, DocRED, EE estimated)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure (appendix): Per-document latency distribution (violin plot, unconstrained vs constrained)\"\n    analysis: |\n      13-20% overhead 是 practical deployment 的可接受范围。\n      Paper framing: \"comparable inference cost with guaranteed compliance\" —\n      the alternative (post-hoc filtering) requires additional pipeline + discards 16-100% of output。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16219,"cache_read_input_tokens":58900,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16219},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9232b49e-c297-4539-b9ff-b35d0393b5b9","uuid":"67ad36de-4344-46da-8590-741db78a3186"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":671679,"duration_api_ms":673644,"num_turns":5,"result":"Now I have the full picture. Let me produce the best-tier predictions for all experiments in the plan.\n\n```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: |\n  Original framing 完全成立：OntoCoDec 是首个 universal ontology-constrained structured generation framework，\n  跨 2 任务（RE+EE）× 4 模型（8B×3 + 70B）× 3 数据集验证。\n  70B DocRED unconstrained DR ~11% 彻底否定 \"scale solves it\"；constrained DR ~1.2% 确认跨规模有效性。\n  Enabling dependency + tightness×RV interaction + fallback frequency 三个非显然 finding\n  在 §5 analysis 中以量化数据支撑，审稿人会将其标注为 surprising。\n  Post-hoc EE 99.6% discard 作为 killer comparison 有效消除 \"just filter\" 替代方案。\n  CF tradeoff 通过 type ambiguity 论证 + proactive disclosure + semantic-layer 消融归因被接受为 inherent limitation。\n  Title 升级为 \"universal\" 或 \"task-agnostic\"，reviewer avg score 预期 3.75–4.0。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ========== Phase 0: Violation Landscape (ALL DONE) ==========\n  - name: \"SciERC violation rate (minimal prompt)\"\n    plan_id: P001\n    description: \"Qwen3-8B zero-shot SciERC, minimal prompt, unconstrained. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 15.37\n      RV_pct: 1.39\n      ET_pct: 0.40\n      CF_pct: 0.08\n      total_triples: 1724\n      total_entities: 2474\n      per_relation_DR_Used_for: 0.76\n      per_relation_DR_Compare: 42.42\n      per_relation_DR_Feature_of: 33.54\n    result_rationale: |\n      7-relation SciERC ontology 中，tight-constraint relations (Feature-of τ=0.24, Compare τ=0.18)\n      驱动高 DR，而 loose-constraint Used-for (τ=0.86) 几乎无违规。15.4% 整体 DR 在小 ontology 上\n      已非 trivial。Compare 42.4% 的极高违规率表明 model 对特定 relation 的 type assignment\n      存在系统性偏差，不是随机错误。Conjunction DR=0% (任意 entity type 均合法) 提供负对照。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2: Per-relation violation rates (SciERC Phase 0)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 2 (left): Per-relation DR heatmap with constraint tightness (τ) annotation\"\n    analysis: |\n      Per-relation variance (0–42.4%) 比整体 DR=15.4% 更有叙事价值。引出 Claim 1 核心 insight：\n      violation rate 由 constraint tightness 驱动，非 ontology size 或 model capability。\n\n  - name: \"SciERC violation rate (schema-informed prompt)\"\n    plan_id: P002\n    description: \"Qwen3-8B SciERC, explicit constraint descriptions in prompt. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 5.78\n      DR_reduction_pct: 62.4\n      Evaluate_for_DR: 29.9\n      Evaluate_for_delta: +5.8\n      Compare_DR: 27.6\n      Feature_of_DR: 11.3\n    result_rationale: |\n      Prompt-level intervention 在统计上有效 (↓62.4%) 但 per-relation 不可靠。Evaluate-for\n      从 24.1% 升到 29.9% (+5.8pp) 是 prior-constraint conflict 的直接证据：model 学到\n      避免 Method→Task (减少 46 个违规) 但剩余 boundary cases 的 type assignment 更不稳定。\n      三个 relation 保持 >10% DR 证明 prompt 方法无法提供 per-instance guarantee。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 2: Schema-informed column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      Evaluate-for regression 是整篇论文最有说服力的单个 data point：\n      prompt 不仅 insufficient 且可能 counterproductive。直接引出 decoding-time enforcement 动机。\n\n  - name: \"DocRED violation rate (minimal prompt)\"\n    plan_id: P003\n    description: \"Qwen3-8B DocRED zero-shot unconstrained. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 18.7\n      RV_pct: 28.9\n      ET_pct: 7.5\n      total_triples: 16540\n    result_rationale: |\n      96-relation DocRED DR=18.7% ≈ 7-relation SciERC DR=15.4%，14× ontology size 差异\n      未导致 violation rate 按比例增长。高 RV=28.9% 因 DocRED 使用 P-number 关系名\n      (P31_instance_of 等) 非自然语言，model 大量生成 OOV relation names。\n      ET=7.5% 因 DocRED 15 类 entity types 含 model 不熟悉的类别 (e.g., astronomical_body)。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 3: DocRED violation landscape\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      DocRED 18.7% ≈ SciERC 15.4% 是 \"tightness not size\" 的定量证据。\n      RV=28.9% 预示 grammar 层在 DocRED 上将有巨大 impact。\n\n  - name: \"DocRED violation rate (schema-informed prompt)\"\n    plan_id: P004\n    description: \"Qwen3-8B DocRED with schema-informed prompt. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 12.8\n      DR_reduction_pct: 32\n    result_rationale: |\n      Prompt ↓32% (vs SciERC ↓62%) 量化了 prompt scalability failure：96 relations 的\n      约束信息在 context window 中被 diluted，model 无法有效利用。这不是 prompt quality 问题\n      (same prompt template)，而是 ontology complexity 的固有 ceiling。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 3: Schema-informed column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      SciERC ↓62% vs DocRED ↓32% 建立 prompt intervention 的 complexity-dependent ceiling。\n      两个 data points 即足以论证趋势。\n\n  # ========== Phase 2: SciERC 4-way Ablation (ALL DONE) ==========\n  - name: \"SciERC unconstrained baseline (Phase 2)\"\n    plan_id: P005a\n    description: \"Qwen3-8B SciERC unconstrained, v2 checker. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 15.37\n      RV_pct: 1.39\n      ET_pct: 0.40\n      CF_pct: 0.08\n      R_F1: 8.23\n      E_F1: 31.01\n    result_rationale: |\n      与 P001 一致（同一 inference output, 新 checker）。CF=0.08% 是 natural baseline —— \n      unconstrained 下 model 的 type assignment 跨 relation 已基本一致。\n      CF 升高是 constrained-only 现象。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 4: SciERC ablation matrix, unconstrained column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Ablation 基准点。\"\n\n  - name: \"SciERC grammar-only\"\n    plan_id: P005\n    description: \"Qwen3-8B SciERC grammar constraints only (XGrammar CFG). 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 14.84\n      RV_pct: 0\n      ET_pct: 0\n      CF_pct: 0.08\n      R_F1: 8.23\n      E_F1: 30.98\n    result_rationale: |\n      Grammar 消灭 RV/ET (CFG 强制 vocabulary) 但 DR 基本不变 (14.84 vs 15.37)。\n      原因：domain/range 约束需要跨 field 状态信息 (entity registry)，grammar CFG 无此能力。\n      DR 微降 0.53pp 是统计噪音而非系统性效果。F1 完全不变——grammar 约束是结构性的，\n      不扭曲 probability distribution。CF=0.08% 与 unconstrained 持平，确认 CF 100%\n      由 semantic 层引入。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 4: grammar_only column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      Grammar 层功能精确：消灭 vocabulary-level violations (RV, ET)，不触及 semantic violations (DR)。\n      为 enabling dependency 论证提供 clean baseline。\n\n  - name: \"SciERC semantic-only\"\n    plan_id: P006\n    description: \"Qwen3-8B SciERC semantic constraints only (no grammar). 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 11.65\n      RV_pct: 1.51\n      ET_pct: 0.40\n      CF_pct: 2.71\n      R_F1: 8.15\n    result_rationale: |\n      Semantic layer alone 仅 ↓24% DR (vs full ↓94%)。关键机制：unconstrained generation\n      产生 ~1.5% OOV relation names → semantic layer 无法 look up 这些 relation 的 domain/range\n      → 对这些 triples 完全无效。此外，non-standard entity types (ET=0.40%) 导致 type matching\n      失败，进一步削弱 semantic enforcement。这是 enabling dependency 的直接证据：\n      grammar 是 semantic 的前提条件，非反过来。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 4: semantic_only column\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 3: DR reduction cascade diagram (unconstrained → grammar_only → semantic_only → full_s1)\"\n    analysis: |\n      24% vs 94% 的巨大 gap 是 enabling dependency 论证的核心。Semantic alone 效果差\n      不是因为 semantic layer 弱，而是因为 input 不满足 semantic layer 的前提条件。\n      这区别于简单 \"synergy\"——是 asymmetric prerequisite。\n\n  - name: \"SciERC full S1\"\n    plan_id: P007\n    description: \"Qwen3-8B SciERC full dual-layer S1 (grammar + semantic, single pass). 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 0.93\n      RV_pct: 0\n      ET_pct: 0\n      CF_pct: 9.90\n      R_F1: 8.36\n      E_F1: 30.98\n      DR_reduction_pct: 94.0\n      R_F1_delta_pp: +0.13\n      R_F1_p: 0.58\n    result_rationale: |\n      Grammar 确保每个 relation name 合法 → semantic layer 可查表执行 domain/range enforcement\n      → DR 从 15.37 降至 0.93 (↓94%)。残余 0.93% 来自 fallback events：当 semantic∩grammar\n      mask 为空集时退化为 grammar-only (该 token 位置无 semantic protection)。\n      SciERC fallback ~10.7 次/doc，远低于 DocRED ~57 次/doc，解释 SciERC 残余更低。\n      R-F1 +0.13pp (p=0.58, NS)：约束不影响 extraction quality。\n      CF 从 0.08% 跃升至 9.90%：semantic 层 per-relation 独立 type enforcement 导致\n      同一 entity 在不同 relation 中被赋予不同 type (EVR 机制)。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 4: full_s1 column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      0.93% residual + 0% RV/ET + F1-neutral 是 SciERC core result。\n      CF=9.90% 是已知 tradeoff，proactive disclosure + type ambiguity 论证 (Generic↔OtherScientificTerm)\n      + semantic-layer 消融归因 (grammar_only CF=0.08%) 构成三层防御。\n\n  - name: \"SciERC full S2 (ablation)\"\n    plan_id: P008\n    description: \"Qwen3-8B SciERC two-pass S2. 已完成。降级为 ablation。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 0.97\n      CF_pct: 8.03\n      R_F1: 8.03\n      E_F1: 31.90\n    result_rationale: |\n      S2 DR=0.97% ≈ S1 0.93%；CF=8.03% vs S1 9.90% (↓1.87pp, 不显著)；\n      R-F1=8.03% < S1 8.36% (error propagation from Pass 1)。\n      S2 不解决 CF——两种策略的 CF 差异在统计噪音内。\n      降级为 §5/appendix architectural ablation，证明框架灵活性而非优越性。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table (appendix): S1 vs S2 comparison\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      S2 data confirms S1 as recommended strategy. S2 in paper serves as:\n      (1) architectural flexibility evidence, (2) confirmation CF is inherent (not S1-specific).\n\n  # ========== Phase 2: DocRED 4-way Ablation (ALL DONE) ==========\n  - name: \"DocRED unconstrained baseline\"\n    plan_id: P009\n    description: \"Qwen3-8B DocRED unconstrained, v2 checker. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 18.46\n      RV_pct: 29.66\n      ET_pct: 2.48\n      CF_pct: 0.10\n      R_F1: 7.74\n      E_F1: 58.15\n      total_triples: 17497\n      unrecognized_relations: 5189\n    result_rationale: |\n      5189 个 OOV relation predictions (29.66%) 是 Qwen 在 DocRED 96-type schema 上的\n      主要 failure mode。这些 OOV predictions 在 all_set F1 method 下计入 FP denominator，\n      压低 precision/F1。Grammar 层消灭 OOV 后将直接提升 F1。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 5: DocRED ablation matrix, unconstrained column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"High RV baseline is key to understanding DocRED dynamics.\"\n\n  - name: \"DocRED grammar-only\"\n    plan_id: P010\n    description: \"Qwen3-8B DocRED grammar-only. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 26.17\n      RV_pct: 0.03\n      ET_pct: 0\n      CF_pct: 0.07\n      R_F1: 8.31\n      E_F1: 59.38\n    result_rationale: |\n      DR 从 18.46% 上升到 26.17% (+7.71pp)——latent violation surfacing effect。\n      机制：grammar 将 5189 个 OOV predictions 强制映射到 96 个合法 relation names →\n      这些 triple 现在可被 DR checker 检测 → 暴露大量原本隐藏在 OOV 背后的 domain/range\n      违规。这是比简单 \"grammar reduces violations\" 更深的 insight。\n      E-F1 从 58.15 升至 59.38 (+1.23pp)：grammar 消灭 ET violations (OOV entity types\n      计为 FP → E-F1 上升)。Grammar 是 F1 提升的唯一来源 (full_s1 E-F1=59.37 ≈ 59.38)。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 5: grammar_only column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      Latent violation surfacing 是 D014 的经验基础：同一 ontology tightness 下，\n      model RV baseline 决定 grammar 层暴露多少 latent DR → 决定 full_s1 residual DR 上限。\n      这个 finding 超出 \"grammar helps\" 的 trivial expectation。\n\n  - name: \"DocRED semantic-only\"\n    plan_id: P011\n    description: \"Qwen3-8B DocRED semantic-only. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 13.84\n      RV_pct: 29.87\n      ET_pct: 4.22\n      CF_pct: 1.05\n      R_F1: 7.70\n    result_rationale: |\n      与 SciERC 同样的 enabling dependency pattern：RV=29.87% 持续 → semantic layer\n      对 ~30% triples 无能力 → DR 仅 ↓25%。ET 上升到 4.22% (vs unconstrained 2.48%)\n      是补偿效应：semantic masking 压力下 model 转向生成非标准 entity types。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 5: semantic_only column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Confirms enabling dependency on 96-relation schema — same mechanism as SciERC.\"\n\n  - name: \"DocRED full S1\"\n    plan_id: P012\n    description: \"Qwen3-8B DocRED full S1. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 10.21\n      RV_pct: 0.03\n      ET_pct: 0\n      CF_pct: 2.57\n      R_F1: 8.23\n      E_F1: 59.37\n      DR_reduction_pct: 44.7\n      R_F1_delta_pp: +0.50\n      R_F1_p: \"<0.001\"\n      E_F1_delta_pp: +1.22\n      E_F1_p: \"<0.001\"\n      fallback_events_per_doc: 57\n    result_rationale: |\n      DR↓45% (vs SciERC ↓94%) 不是方法失败而是 D014 dual-factor 的预测结果：\n      DocRED τ̄=0.842 (tight) × Qwen RV=29.66% (high) → grammar surfacing 暴露大量 latent DR\n      → residual 10.21%。Fallback ~57 次/doc (vs SciERC ~10.7) 量化了 constraint coverage gap。\n      R-F1 +0.50pp (p<0.001) 显著正向：OOV relation names 被强制匹配合法名 → 部分原本被计为 FP\n      的 predictions 变为 TP → precision ↑。这是 grammar 层的 secondary benefit。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 5: full_s1 column\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 4: tightness × RV baseline interaction plot (4 model-dataset combinations)\"\n    analysis: |\n      10.21% residual + 45% reduction 在 paper 中不作为 weakness 而是作为 D014 tightness×RV\n      interaction finding 的经验支撑。Fallback frequency (57/doc) 定义 \"Constraint Coverage\"\n      metric，把残余 DR 从 unexplained gap 变成 quantifiable phenomenon。\n\n  # ========== Cross-Model Validation (ALL DONE) ==========\n  - name: \"Llama SciERC unconstrained\"\n    plan_id: P013\n    description: \"Llama-3.1-8B SciERC unconstrained. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 13.34\n      RV_pct: 0.55\n      ET_pct: 0\n      R_F1: 2.68\n      E_F1: 23.56\n    result_rationale: |\n      Llama violation profile 不同于 Qwen：RV 更低 (0.55% vs 1.39%)，DR 略低 (13.34% vs 15.37%)。\n      低 RV 意味着 grammar 层 latent surfacing 更少 → 预测 constrained DR 将显著低于 Qwen。\n      R-F1=2.68% (vs Qwen 8.23%) 反映 Llama-8B 在 SciERC zero-shot 上 extraction quality 较差，\n      但 F1 是控制变量不是优化目标。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 6: Cross-model matrix\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      Llama 低 RV + 中 DR vs Qwen 中 RV + 中 DR → RV↓DR↑ orthogonality 的起点。\n      两层约束解决正交 failure modes。\n\n  - name: \"Llama SciERC full S1\"\n    plan_id: P014\n    description: \"Llama-3.1-8B SciERC full S1, zero code modification. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 0.08\n      DR_reduction_pct: 99.4\n      RV_pct: 0\n      ET_pct: 0\n      CF_pct: 6.56\n      R_F1: 2.54\n      R_F1_delta_pp: -0.14\n      R_F1_p: 0.011\n    result_rationale: |\n      ↓99.4% 因 Llama 低 RV (0.55%) → grammar surfacing minimal → semantic layer 几乎对所有\n      triples 生效。DR=0.08% (仅 1 个违规) 实质上为零。R-F1 -0.14pp (p=0.011) 虽统计显著\n      但绝对值可忽略 (-0.14 out of 2.68, <1% relative change)。\n      CF=6.56% 高于 Qwen SciERC (9.90%) 的 per-entity rate 但方向一致——non-local constraint\n      问题在 Llama 上更突出。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 6: Llama SciERC full_s1 column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      99.4% DR reduction 零代码修改是 cross-model 的 headline。\"Generalizes across model families\n      without code modification\" 是程序性事实 (iron-clad claim)。\n\n  - name: \"Llama DocRED unconstrained\"\n    plan_id: P015\n    description: \"Llama-3.1-8B DocRED unconstrained. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 26.07\n      RV_pct: 16.03\n      ET_pct: 0.13\n      CF_pct: 0.17\n      R_F1: 5.98\n      E_F1: 55.65\n    result_rationale: |\n      Llama DocRED: RV=16.03% (vs Qwen 29.66%) 但 DR=26.07% (vs Qwen 18.46%)。\n      RV↓DR↑ 反向于 Qwen——vocabulary compliance ≠ semantic compliance 的直接证据。\n      Llama 更擅长记忆 P-number relation names (fewer OOV) 但对 domain/range 语义约束\n      理解更差 (more violations in valid relations)。这是 §5 cross-model independent finding。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 6: Llama DocRED unconstrained column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      RV↓DR↑ orthogonality: Llama 和 Qwen 在 DocRED 上失败模式正交 →\n      两层约束分别处理各自的 failure mode → 架构论证更有力。\n\n  - name: \"Llama DocRED full S1\"\n    plan_id: P016\n    description: \"Llama-3.1-8B DocRED full S1. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 2.55\n      DR_reduction_pct: 90.2\n      RV_pct: 0\n      ET_pct: 0\n      CF_pct: 12.02\n      R_F1: 6.27\n      R_F1_delta_pp: +0.29\n      R_F1_p: 0.013\n      E_F1: 55.01\n      E_F1_delta_pp: -0.64\n      parse_failures: 91\n    result_rationale: |\n      Llama DocRED ↓90.2% (vs Qwen 同 dataset ↓44.7%)——D014 dual-factor 的最强证据：\n      同一 ontology (τ̄=0.842) 但 Llama RV=16.03% << Qwen 29.66%，\n      grammar surfacing 更少 → residual DR 更低 (2.55% vs 10.21%)。\n      R-F1 +0.29pp (p=0.013) 正向且显著 (two models both positive on DocRED)。\n      CF=12.02% 高于 Qwen (2.57%)——model-dependent CF variation。\n      Parse failures 91/998 (9.1%) vs unconstrained 68 (6.8%)——constrained decoding\n      增加约束 token 导致 max_tokens 不足的概率上升。偏差方向保守 (不利于 constrained)。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 6: Llama DocRED full_s1 column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      Llama 90.2% vs Qwen 44.7% 在同一 dataset 上是 D014 的决定性证据。\n      Two data points fully explained by tightness × RV baseline model。\n      Paper 中应在 §5 展开 dual-factor analysis 并呈现 4-point interaction plot。\n\n  # ========== Supplementary (ALL DONE) ==========\n  - name: \"S2 pilot (50 docs)\"\n    plan_id: P017\n    description: \"S2 pilot run on 50 SciERC docs. 已完成，被 P008 full run superseded。\"\n    expected_results:\n      DR_pct: 2.05\n      R_F1: 10.08\n      samples: 50\n    result_rationale: |\n      小样本 pilot 确认 S2 可运行，但 DR=2.05% (n=146 triples) 是高方差估计。\n      Full run P008 (n=1644 triples) DR=0.97% 是可靠值。不在论文中引用 pilot 数字。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Superseded by P008. Do not cite pilot50 DR=0% (原始 dryrun artifact)。\"\n\n  - name: \"Post-hoc filtering baseline\"\n    plan_id: P018\n    description: \"Post-hoc filtering on Qwen SciERC + DocRED. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      scierc_R_F1_posthoc: 8.63\n      scierc_R_F1_OntoCoDec: 8.36\n      scierc_reject_pct: 16.8\n      scierc_TP_lost: 7\n      docred_R_F1_posthoc: 9.61\n      docred_R_F1_OntoCoDec: 8.23\n      docred_reject_pct: 48.1\n      docred_TP_lost: 127\n      docred_ET_residual: 2.47\n    result_rationale: |\n      Post-hoc F1 > OntoCoDec F1 (SciERC 8.63 vs 8.36, DocRED 9.61 vs 8.23)，因 low-F1\n      regime 下删除 violating triples (大部分是 FP) 大幅提升 precision。\n      但 DocRED 丢弃 48.1% triples + 127 个 TP (11.2%)。\n      Framing: multi-dimensional (recall ↑ vs ↓, coverage, operational, ET residual)。\n      Post-hoc 无法解决 ET (残余 2.47%) 因它只删 triples 不改 entity list。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 7: OntoCoDec vs post-hoc multi-dimensional comparison\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      不以 F1 论高低。OntoCoDec recall 上升 + post-hoc recall 下降是核心论据。\n      127 个 lost TP 是 \"prevent vs detect\" 最具体的数据点。\n\n  - name: \"Bootstrap CI (10000 iterations)\"\n    plan_id: P019\n    description: \"Bootstrap CI for all F1 metrics. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_scierc_R_F1_delta: +0.13\n      qwen_scierc_R_F1_p: 0.58\n      qwen_docred_R_F1_delta: +0.50\n      qwen_docred_R_F1_p: \"<0.001\"\n      qwen_docred_R_F1_CI: \"[+0.23, +0.81]\"\n      qwen_docred_E_F1_delta: +1.23\n      qwen_docred_E_F1_p: \"<0.001\"\n      llama_scierc_R_F1_delta: -0.14\n      llama_scierc_R_F1_p: 0.011\n      llama_docred_R_F1_delta: +0.29\n      llama_docred_R_F1_p: 0.013\n    result_rationale: |\n      DocRED R-F1 显著提升 (both models p<0.02) 因 OOV elimination reduces FP。\n      SciERC R-F1 中性/可忽略 (Qwen NS, Llama borderline) 因 SciERC RV baseline 低，\n      grammar 层 FP reduction 效果有限。\n      Cross-model pattern: DocRED F1 positive (both), SciERC F1 neutral — consistent story。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table (appendix): Full bootstrap CI table\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Statistical rigor layer. All p-values reported in paper.\"\n\n  # ========== WikiEvents Event Extraction (D040, ALL DONE except post-hoc computed) ==========\n  - name: \"WikiEvents Qwen3-8B unconstrained\"\n    plan_id: P021\n    description: \"WikiEvents EE, Qwen3-8B unconstrained. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      parse_rate_pct: 88.6\n      EV_pct: 24.0\n      RoV_pct: 74.9\n      AC_pct: 0.3\n      CF_pct: 0\n      trigger_F1: 11.84\n      entity_F1: 0\n      argument_F1: 0.09\n    result_rationale: |\n      RoV=74.9% 是压倒性违规——EE 的 80 argument roles conditioned on 56 event types\n      远超 model 从 prompt 学习的容量。EV=24% 因生成非 KAIROS event types。\n      Entity F1=0% 不是 model 无能力——是 unconstrained JSON 格式太 malformed，\n      parser 无法提取 entity mentions。AC=0.3% 极低因大部分 triples 都被 RoV 覆盖\n      (invalid role → 无法检查 argument type constraint)。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 8: WikiEvents 3-model results\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      RoV 74.9% (EE) vs RV 1.4% (RE SciERC) 是最直观的 \"EE needs constraint more than RE\" evidence。\n      Entity F1=0%→constrained 14.1% 是 format compliance recovery 的 dramatic demonstration。\n\n  - name: \"WikiEvents Qwen3-8B constrained (full_s1 v3)\"\n    plan_id: P022\n    description: \"WikiEvents EE, Qwen3-8B, full S1, collision+exact-match fix. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      parse_rate_pct: 83.7\n      EV_pct: 0\n      RoV_pct: 0\n      AC_pct: 2.1\n      CF_pct: 21.1\n      trigger_F1: 13.39\n      entity_F1: 14.09\n      argument_F1: 1.68\n    result_rationale: |\n      三层级联 Grammar→RoV→AC：grammar 消灭 EV→0% (CFG 强制 56 event types)；\n      semantic continuation masking 消灭 RoV→0% (80 roles per-event-type enforcement)；\n      AC=2.1% 残余来自 model 语义混淆 (SID vs SEN 等相近 entity types，non-collision related\n      因 Qwen 0 collision groups)。\n      Entity F1 从 0%→14.1%：纯粹 format compliance recovery——grammar 产生 schema-valid JSON，\n      parser 才能识别 entity mentions。不是语义改进。\n      CF=21.1% 高于 RE (9.9% SciERC)：EE argument structure 更复杂 (多个 event 共享 entity，\n      每个 event 独立 type assignment)，CF tradeoff 更明显。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 8: Qwen constrained column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      EV/RoV→0% across all 3 models 是 cross-task generalization 的核心证据。\n      三层级联 (Grammar→RoV→AC) 比 RE 两层 (Grammar→DR) 更丰富——architecture contribution 更强。\n\n  - name: \"WikiEvents Llama-3.1-8B unconstrained\"\n    plan_id: P023\n    description: \"WikiEvents EE, Llama-3.1-8B unconstrained. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      parse_rate_pct: 91.9\n      EV_pct: 10.5\n      RoV_pct: 88.8\n      AC_pct: 0.1\n      CF_pct: 0\n      trigger_F1: 5.72\n      entity_F1: 0\n    result_rationale: |\n      Llama RoV=88.8% (highest across all experiments)——对 role vocabulary 的记忆最差。\n      但 EV=10.5% (lowest among 3 models)——对 event type vocabulary 记忆更好。\n      这与 RE 中 Llama 低 RV 但高 DR 的模式一致：vocabulary-level vs semantic-level\n      failure 因 model 而异。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 8: Llama unconstrained column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"RoV=88.8% is the highest violation rate in the paper — strongest evidence for constraint necessity.\"\n\n  - name: \"WikiEvents Llama-3.1-8B constrained (full_s1 v3)\"\n    plan_id: P024\n    description: \"WikiEvents EE, Llama-3.1-8B, full S1 v3. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      parse_rate_pct: 84.1\n      EV_pct: 0\n      RoV_pct: 0\n      AC_pct: 3.8\n      CF_pct: 17.2\n      trigger_F1: 7.48\n      entity_F1: 17.63\n    result_rationale: |\n      Pattern 与 Qwen 一致：EV/RoV→0%，AC 残余 3.8% (略高于 Qwen 2.1%)。\n      Llama AC 稍高因对 KAIROS entity types 的 semantic understanding 略弱\n      (但无 BPE collision 问题——Llama 0 collision groups)。\n      Entity F1=17.6% (highest among 3 models)：Llama entity mention 质量更好\n      (当 format valid 时)。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 8: Llama constrained column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Cross-model consistency: EV/RoV→0% regardless of model. AC varies 2.1-3.8%.\"\n\n  - name: \"WikiEvents Mistral-7B unconstrained\"\n    plan_id: P025\n    description: \"WikiEvents EE, Mistral-7B-v0.3 unconstrained. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      parse_rate_pct: 78.9\n      EV_pct: 37.3\n      RoV_pct: 63.9\n      AC_pct: 0\n      CF_pct: 0\n      trigger_F1: 2.41\n      entity_F1: 0\n    result_rationale: |\n      Mistral EV=37.3% (highest)——最弱的 event type vocabulary 学习能力。\n      RoV=63.9% (lowest of 3, but still dominant)。AC=0% 因 37.3% invalid event types\n      使大量 triples 无法进行 argument constraint check。\n      Parse rate=78.9% (lowest) 反映 Mistral 在 complex JSON generation 上最弱。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 8: Mistral unconstrained column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: \"Mistral's high EV (37.3%) means grammar layer eliminates 37.3% vocabulary violations for this model.\"\n\n  - name: \"WikiEvents Mistral-7B constrained (full_s1 v3)\"\n    plan_id: P026\n    description: \"WikiEvents EE, Mistral-7B, full S1 v3 with collision fix. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      parse_rate_pct: 88.6\n      EV_pct: 0\n      RoV_pct: 0\n      AC_pct: 1.3\n      CF_pct: 14.9\n      trigger_F1: 3.87\n      entity_F1: 11.71\n    result_rationale: |\n      EV/RoV→0% consistent across all 3 models。AC=1.3% (lowest) after collision fix\n      (v3 resolves SID/SEN/SIDE→'S' and BAL/BOD→'B' collisions)。\n      Parse rate 从 78.9%→88.6% 因 grammar 产生 well-formed JSON。\n      AC 残余 1.3% 是 pure semantic confusion (non-collision, 因 Mistral 有 2 collision groups\n      但 v3 已修复大部分——从 v2 16.6% 降至 v3 1.3%)。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 8: Mistral constrained column\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      3-model consistency on EV/RoV→0% 是 task-agnostic effectiveness 的决定性证据。\n      AC range 1.3-3.8% 反映 model-specific semantic confusion, not method limitation。\n\n  - name: \"WikiEvents Mistral grammar_only v3\"\n    plan_id: P027\n    description: \"Grammar-only ablation on Mistral WikiEvents. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      EV_pct: 0\n      RoV_pct: 64.0\n      AC_pct: 13.8\n      CF_pct: 1.1\n    result_rationale: |\n      Grammar 消灭 EV→0% 但 RoV=64% 持续——grammar CFG 无法 encode per-event-type\n      role constraints (role validity 取决于 event context, 非 static vocabulary)。\n      AC 从 0%→13.8% 是 latent surfacing (同 RE DocRED grammar-only DR rise)：\n      grammar 强制有效 event types 后暴露原本隐藏的 role→entity type 违规。\n      Proves: semantic layer is essential for EE，two-layer architecture is necessary not convenient。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 9: EE ablation (grammar_only vs full_s1)\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      grammar_only RoV=64% vs full RoV=0% 是 semantic layer necessity 的单一最强证据。\n      比 RE 更 dramatic (RE grammar_only DR=14.84%, full DR=0.93%, 差距 14pp；EE 差距 64pp)。\n\n  - name: \"WikiEvents EE post-hoc filtering (3 models)\"\n    plan_id: P028\n    description: \"Post-hoc filtering baseline for EE. 从现有数据计算得出。\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_args_before: 5467\n      qwen_args_after: 23\n      qwen_discard_pct: 99.6\n      llama_args_before: 5053\n      llama_args_after: 3\n      llama_discard_pct: 99.9\n      mistral_args_before: 6034\n      mistral_args_after: 0\n      mistral_discard_pct: 100\n    result_rationale: |\n      EE 的极高 violation rate (RoV 64-89%) 意味着 post-hoc 必须删除几乎所有 arguments。\n      Qwen: 5467→23 (99.6%)，因 RoV=74.9% + EV=24% 导致绝大部分 arguments 违规。\n      Llama: 5053→3 (99.9%)，RoV=88.8% 更高 → 更少幸存。\n      Mistral: 6034→0 (100%)，EV=37.3% + RoV=63.9% 的组合使零 argument 完全合规。\n      对比 RE post-hoc (SciERC 16.8%, DocRED 48.1%)——EE 的 constraint space 使 post-hoc\n      从 \"expensive but functional\" 变成 \"completely non-viable\"。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 10: Post-hoc comparison RE vs EE\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 5: Post-hoc rejection rate bar chart (RE 2 datasets × EE, 3 models)\"\n    analysis: |\n      99.6-100% discard 是 killer comparison。审稿人 \"why not just post-hoc filter?\" 被\n      one number 消灭。EE post-hoc non-viability vs RE post-hoc partial viability\n      也展示了 constraint space complexity 的 monotonic effect。\n\n  # ========== 70B Scale Experiments (P029 DONE, P030 RUNNING) ==========\n  - name: \"70B SciERC unconstrained + constrained\"\n    plan_id: P029\n    description: \"Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct AWQ-INT4, SciERC. 已完成。\"\n    expected_results:\n      unconstrained_DR_pct: 6.5\n      unconstrained_RV_pct: 0.6\n      unconstrained_ET_pct: 0\n      unconstrained_R_F1: 11.22\n      unconstrained_E_F1: 35.17\n      constrained_DR_pct: 0\n      constrained_RV_pct: 0\n      constrained_ET_pct: 0\n      constrained_CF_pct: 3.66\n      constrained_R_F1: 11.24\n      constrained_E_F1: 35.14\n      DR_reduction_pct: 100\n      R_F1_delta_pp: +0.02\n    result_rationale: |\n      70B SciERC unconstrained DR=6.5%——是 8B 的约一半 (Qwen 15.4%, Llama 13.3%)。\n      Scale 减少违规但未消除：每 15 个 triple 仍有 1 个违反 type constraint。\n      这彻底否定 \"scale solves it\" 反驳 (7-relation 小 ontology 上 70B 仍有 6.5% DR)。\n      Constrained DR=0%：SciERC 7-relation schema 足够简单，70B + OntoCoDec = 完美消除。\n      R-F1 +0.02pp (neutral)。CF=3.66% 低于 8B (Qwen 9.90%, Llama 6.56%)——\n      70B 的 type assignment 更稳定，cross-relation consistency 更好。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 11: 70B cross-scale results\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 6: DR across scales (8B×3 + 70B) for SciERC\"\n    analysis: |\n      6.5% at 70B 是 §1 motivation 的经验支撑：即使参数扩大 9×，violations 持续。\n      Constrained DR=0% 确认 OntoCoDec 在 70B 上不仅有效而且 perfect。\n      CF=3.66% (lowest across all models) 暗示 scale 可以缓解 CF tradeoff。\n\n  - name: \"70B DocRED unconstrained + constrained\"\n    plan_id: P030\n    description: \"Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct AWQ-INT4, DocRED. 当前 RUNNING。\"\n    expected_results:\n      unconstrained_DR_pct: 11.0\n      unconstrained_RV_pct: 5.2\n      unconstrained_ET_pct: 0.05\n      unconstrained_CF_pct: 0.12\n      unconstrained_R_F1: 9.8\n      unconstrained_E_F1: 62.5\n      unconstrained_parse_fail_pct: 2.0\n      unconstrained_total_triples: 17500\n      constrained_DR_pct: 1.2\n      constrained_RV_pct: 0\n      constrained_ET_pct: 0\n      constrained_CF_pct: 5.0\n      constrained_R_F1: 10.1\n      constrained_E_F1: 63.0\n      constrained_parse_fail_pct: 3.5\n      DR_reduction_pct: 89.1\n      R_F1_delta_pp: +0.3\n      E_F1_delta_pp: +0.5\n    result_rationale: |\n      === Unconstrained DR ~11% 预测逻辑 ===\n      (1) Scale effect calibration: 70B SciERC DR=6.5% = 8B-Llama SciERC 13.3% × 0.49。\n          8B-Llama DocRED DR=26.07% × 0.49 ≈ 12.8%。但 DocRED tight constraints\n          (τ̄=0.842) 对 scale benefit 有 ceiling——tight-constraint relations\n          (P31_instance_of DR=60%, P1001 DR=44%) 即使 70B 仍难以纠正。\n      (2) Model-family consistency: 70B 是 Llama 家族，DocRED 上 8B-Llama DR=26.07%\n          (highest among 8B models)。Scale 减半但 DocRED 的绝对 floor 更高。\n      (3) 预测 ~11% 落在 best tier [8, 15]：足以否定 \"scale solves it\"\n          (每 9 个 triple 仍有 1 个违规)，同时不太高以至于暗示 \"70B 完全无改善\"。\n\n      === RV ~5.2% ===\n      70B 对 96 relation P-number names 记忆力远优于 8B (Qwen 29.7%, Llama 16%)，\n      但 P-number 是非自然语言标识符，even 70B 会偶尔 OOV。预测 ~5%：\n      8B-Llama RV=16% × 0.33 (scale improvement ratio higher for vocabulary than semantics)。\n\n      === Constrained DR ~1.2% ===\n      (1) Llama-8B DocRED constrained DR=2.55% with RV=16.03%。\n      (2) 70B RV ~5.2% → grammar surfacing 更少 (fewer OOV → fewer latent violations exposed)。\n      (3) 70B semantic understanding 更强 → semantic mask 决策更准确 → fewer fallback events。\n      (4) 8B-Llama SciERC: unconstrained 13.3→constrained 0.08% (↓99.4%)。\n          8B-Llama DocRED: 26.07→2.55% (↓90.2%)。\n          70B DocRED: 11→1.2% (↓89.1%)——与 8B-Llama DocRED 同量级 reduction，\n          略低因 70B 的 lower RV baseline 意味着 residual DR 更多来自 genuinely hard cases\n          (tight constraints + model semantic confusion) 而非 latent surfacing。\n      (5) 1.2% 落在 best tier [0.5, 2.0]。\n\n      === DR reduction ~89% ===\n      在 best tier [85, 95]。Not as high as 8B-Llama SciERC 99.4% 因 DocRED \n      tightness ceiling (同 D014 analysis)。\n\n      === R-F1 +0.3pp ===\n      与 8B-Llama DocRED +0.29pp 一致——OOV elimination 带来的 precision gain。\n      在 best tier [-0.3, 0.5]。\n\n      === CF ~5% ===\n      低于 8B-Llama DocRED (12.02%) 因 70B type assignment 更稳定。\n      高于 70B SciERC (3.66%) 因 DocRED 96-type schema 更复杂。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table 11: 70B DocRED column\"\n      - \"Table 12: Cross-scale summary (8B→70B, 2 datasets, 4 metrics)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure 6 (right): DR across scales for DocRED — 4-point curve (3×8B + 1×70B)\"\n      - \"Figure 7: 2D plot: scale (x) vs DR (y), SciERC and DocRED as two curves — shows ceiling effect on DocRED\"\n    analysis: |\n      70B DocRED 完成 cross-scale × cross-dataset 矩阵的最后一个 cell：\n      \n      |           | SciERC (τ̄=0.40) | DocRED (τ̄=0.84) |\n      |-----------|-----------------|-----------------|\n      | 8B uncon  | 13.3-15.4%      | 18.5-26.1%      |\n      | 8B con    | 0-0.93%         | 2.55-10.21%     |\n      | 70B uncon | 6.5%            | ~11%            |\n      | 70B con   | 0%              | ~1.2%           |\n      \n      Three findings from this matrix:\n      (1) Scale halves violations but doesn't eliminate them (row comparison)\n      (2) Tightness creates ceiling for both unconstrained and constrained DR (column comparison)\n      (3) OntoCoDec is effective across both scales (8B reduction 90-99%, 70B reduction 89-100%)\n      \n      Combined with WikiEvents cross-task data, this gives:\n      2 tasks × 4 models × 3 datasets = complete evidence matrix for \"universal framework\" claim。\n\n  # ========== Error Analysis (PLANNED) ==========\n  - name: \"Error analysis / case study\"\n    plan_id: P031\n    description: \"10-20 representative cases from v3 EE results + RE residual analysis\"\n    expected_results:\n      ee_ac_residual_total: 35\n      ac_semantic_confusion_pct: 72\n      ac_collision_residual_pct: 12\n      ac_boundary_case_pct: 16\n      cf_evr_dominated_pct: 88\n      cf_type_ambiguity_examples: 5\n      re_docred_residual_dr_tight_relation_pct: 80\n      representative_cases: 15\n    result_rationale: |\n      AC residual (2-4%) 预测根因分布：\n      (1) ~72% semantic confusion：model 混淆语义相近 entity types (SID vs SEN = \"side\" vs\n          \"sentence\"，PER vs GPE = 人名 vs 地名 in ambiguous contexts)。\n          这些是 genuine 语义 boundary cases, 非 tokenizer/engineering 问题。\n      (2) ~12% BPE collision 残余：Mistral 的 2 collision groups (S-prefix, B-prefix)\n          v3 修复后仍有少量 edge cases (multi-token entity types where first token disambiguates\n          but model hasn't fully adapted to new constraint)。\n      (3) ~16% 真正 boundary cases：annotation-disagreement-level ambiguity，\n          即人类标注者也可能不同意的 type assignment。这类错误不可能消除。\n\n      CF root cause (15-21%)：>88% 是 EVR (entity-vs-relation type drift)——\n      同一 entity 在 entity list 中的 type 与 relation argument 中的 type 不一致。\n      这是 per-relation 独立 type enforcement 的直接后果。\n      Top 冲突模式将平行 RE SciERC 的 Generic↔OtherScientificTerm pattern，\n      但 EE 中是 PER↔SID、LOC↔GPE 等更细粒度的混淆。\n\n      Case study 将提供 5 个 CF type ambiguity examples，让审稿人直观理解\n      \"CF 是 type system 语义边界模糊的体现，非方法 bug\"。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure (appendix): 3-panel error case illustration (AC semantic confusion, CF type ambiguity, boundary case)\"\n    analysis: |\n      Case study 的论文功能：(1) 为 AC residual 提供 qualitative evidence 支撑\n      \"inherent model semantic confusion\" framing; (2) 为 CF 提供 \"type system ambiguity\"\n      的具体 examples; (3) 展示 OntoCoDec 的 debugging 价值——约束让 violation pattern\n      变得可分析 (unconstrained 的 >70% RoV 掩盖了所有细粒度 pattern)。\n\n  # ========== D049 Tier 2 (PLANNED) ==========\n  - name: \"EE FT composability\"\n    plan_id: P032\n    description: \"Fine-tuned model + OntoCoDec on WikiEvents EE. Priority 2, 时间紧。\"\n    expected_results:\n      ft_unconstrained_trigger_F1: 42\n      ft_unconstrained_argument_F1: 22\n      ft_unconstrained_entity_F1: 55\n      ft_unconstrained_EV_pct: 0.5\n      ft_unconstrained_RoV_pct: 3.0\n      ft_unconstrained_AC_pct: 1.8\n      ft_constrained_trigger_F1: 42\n      ft_constrained_argument_F1: 22.3\n      ft_constrained_entity_F1: 55\n      ft_constrained_EV_pct: 0\n      ft_constrained_RoV_pct: 0\n      ft_constrained_AC_pct: 0.2\n      ft_constrained_CF_pct: 2.5\n      delta_arg_F1_pp: +0.3\n    result_rationale: |\n      RE FT composability 已确认：4 个 FT 实验 (Qwen/Llama × SciERC/DocRED)\n      均显示 DR reduction + F1 neutral/positive。\n      EE FT 预期类似 pattern：\n      (1) FT 大幅提升 F1 (zero-shot trigger ~12% → FT ~42%, argument ~0% → ~22%)。\n      (2) FT 后 violations 大幅降低但不归零：RoV 从 75-89% 降至 ~3%\n          (FT learns role vocabulary but still makes occasional errors)。\n          AC 从 ~0.3% 升至 ~1.8% (FT 产生更多 valid role assignments → 更多可被 AC check 覆盖)。\n      (3) Constrained 后 RoV→0%, AC→0.2%, F1 neutral (+0.3pp)。\n      (4) CF ~2.5% (远低于 zero-shot 15-21%) 因 FT 稳定了 type assignment。\n\n      如果 ~30 GPU-hours budget 不够或时间不足 (May 25 deadline)：\n      RE FT 4 实验 + EE zero-shot 3 实验已足够支撑 \"composability\" claim。\n      P032 是 bonus evidence，非 critical path。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table (appendix): FT+OntoCoDec composability (RE 4 experiments + EE 1 experiment)\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      FT composability 回应 \"only works in zero-shot?\" 潜在质疑。\n      RE 数据已充分 (4/4 positive)；EE FT 是 completeness bonus。\n      即使 skip P032，论文仍可声明 \"composable with fine-tuned models (verified on RE)\"。\n\n  # ========== D049 Tier 3 (PLANNED) ==========\n  - name: \"Grammar-only cross-model validation (Qwen/Llama EE)\"\n    plan_id: P033\n    description: \"Grammar-only ablation on Qwen and Llama WikiEvents for completeness\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_grammar_only_EV: 0\n      qwen_grammar_only_RoV: 68\n      qwen_grammar_only_AC: 11\n      qwen_grammar_only_CF: 0.5\n      llama_grammar_only_EV: 0\n      llama_grammar_only_RoV: 76\n      llama_grammar_only_AC: 14\n      llama_grammar_only_CF: 0.3\n    result_rationale: |\n      Mistral grammar-only 已确认 pattern (RoV=64%, AC=13.8%)。\n      Qwen/Llama 预测 RoV 67-77%：\n      - Qwen unconstrained RoV=74.9% → grammar-only 应稍降 (grammar 强制 valid event types\n        改变生成 context → 可能略影响 role generation) → ~68%。\n      - Llama unconstrained RoV=88.8% → grammar-only ~76% (比 Qwen 高因 baseline 更高)。\n      AC 上升到 11-14% (latent surfacing: grammar 强制 valid event types → 更多 triples\n      可被 AC checker 检测 → 暴露 latent argument type violations)。\n      \n      Priority 3：Mistral 单模型 ablation 已足够支撑 \"semantic layer essential for EE\"。\n      3 模型一致性增加 robustness 但非 critical。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table (appendix): EE grammar-only ablation (3 models)\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      3-model grammar-only consistency: EV→0% (grammar works), RoV stays 64-77% (grammar insufficient),\n      AC rises (latent surfacing). Same pattern across models strengthens claim。\n\n  - name: \"Bootstrap CI for EE metrics\"\n    plan_id: P034\n    description: \"10000-iteration bootstrap CI for EE F1 changes\"\n    expected_results:\n      qwen_entity_F1_delta: +14.09\n      qwen_entity_F1_p: \"<0.001\"\n      qwen_trigger_F1_delta: +1.55\n      qwen_trigger_F1_p: 0.015\n      llama_entity_F1_delta: +17.63\n      llama_entity_F1_p: \"<0.001\"\n      llama_trigger_F1_delta: +1.76\n      llama_trigger_F1_p: 0.03\n      mistral_entity_F1_delta: +11.71\n      mistral_entity_F1_p: \"<0.001\"\n      mistral_trigger_F1_delta: +1.46\n      mistral_trigger_F1_p: 0.05\n    result_rationale: |\n      Entity F1 从 0→11-18% 的 recovery 必然高度显著 (p≪0.001)——\n      变化量远大于 bootstrap variance (binomial CI at 246 docs is narrow)。\n      Trigger F1 +1.5-1.8pp 在 borderline significant：\n      246 docs 的 bootstrap CI width ~±1pp，+1.5pp 勉强超出但 p 在 0.01-0.05 之间。\n      Argument F1 changes 太小 (<2pp absolute on near-zero baseline) → 可能 NS。\n      \n      Priority 3：Entity F1 significance 是 guaranteed (trivial to prove)；\n      trigger F1 significance 是 borderline (nice-to-have)；\n      argument F1 significance 无关紧要 (near-zero baseline)。\n      不影响 core claims (mechanism generalization 是 contribution, not SOTA F1)。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table (appendix): Bootstrap CI for EE metrics (3 models × 3 metrics)\"\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: |\n      Statistical rigor layer for EE. Entity F1 recovery significance is guaranteed.\n      对 acceptance decision 影响小但增加 soundness perception。\n\n  - name: \"Latency overhead measurement\"\n    plan_id: P035\n    description: \"Wall-clock latency comparison. SciERC 已完成, DocRED RUNNING。\"\n    expected_results:\n      scierc_overhead_pct: 13.1\n      scierc_mean_unconstrained_s: 4.16\n      scierc_mean_constrained_s: 4.71\n      docred_overhead_pct: 17.5\n      docred_mean_unconstrained_s: 23.5\n      docred_mean_constrained_s: 27.6\n      ee_overhead_pct_estimated: 20\n    result_rationale: |\n      SciERC 已测 13.1% overhead (4.16s→4.71s, 7-relation schema)。\n      DocRED 预测 ~17.5%：\n      (1) 96 relations → semantic mask lookup 需遍历更多 type rules per token。\n      (2) 更多 fallback events (~57/doc vs ~10.7/doc) → fallback handling overhead。\n      (3) 但 mask computation 是 O(|R|) per token, |R|=96 vs 7 = 13.7× more lookups，\n          而 mask computation 仅占总 inference time 的 ~10% → overhead 增量有限。\n      (4) 预测 17-18%，仍 <20%。\n\n      EE 估计 ~20%：56 event types × 80 roles × 27 entity types 的三层 mask\n      (RE 只有 grammar→semantic 两层，EE 有 grammar→role→argument 三层)\n      但 token generation 仍是瓶颈，mask computation 占比小。\n\n      总体 framing：<25% overhead for guaranteed type compliance。\n      相比 post-hoc filtering 需额外 pipeline + 人工审查的成本，微不足道。\n    tables:\n      - \"Table (appendix): Latency overhead (SciERC, DocRED, EE estimated)\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Figure (appendix): Per-document latency distribution (violin plot, unconstrained vs constrained)\"\n    analysis: |\n      13-20% overhead 是 practical deployment 的可接受范围。\n      Paper framing: \"comparable inference cost with guaranteed compliance\" —\n      the alternative (post-hoc filtering) requires additional pipeline + discards 16-100% of output。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"9232b49e-c297-4539-b9ff-b35d0393b5b9","total_cost_usd":1.3650435,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":63278,"cache_read_input_tokens":165338,"output_tokens":34263,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":63278,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":1